#30669
Pine Grove~
   You have entered a rather seedy area of town, the slums that line the
northern half of Pine Grove being legendary the world over.  A haven for
thieves, assassins, backstabbers, footpads and murderers of every description,
it is a place where a quick mind and a quicker blade will mean the difference
between life and death.  You quickly duck the contents of a chamber pot being
emptied into the street by someone in a higher building, and, cursing, move on.
  
~
